-## Event Types
+## 事件类型完整列表
 
-| Event Type | Description | Key Fields |
-|------------|-------------|------------|
-| `agent_registered` | New agent registered | `agent_id`, `org_id` |
-| `agent_approved` | Agent approved by admin | `agent_id`, `actor_id` |
-| `agent_suspended` | Agent suspended | `agent_id`, `actor_id` |
-| `grant_created` | User authorized agent | `agent_id`, `user_id` |
-| `grant_revoked` | Agent authorization revoked | `agent_id`, `user_id`, `actor_id` |
-| `agent_action` | Agent performed operation on behalf of user | `agent_id`, `user_id`, `resource` |
-| `token_issued` | Token issued to agent | `agent_id` |
+| 事件类型 | 触发方 | 核心字段 | 说明 |
+|----------|--------|----------|------|
+| `agent_registered` | WinAMZ 系统 | `agent_id`, `org_id` | 新 Agent 注册提交审批 |
+| `agent_approved` | WinAMZ 系统 | `agent_id`, `actor_id` | 管理员批准 Agent |
+| `agent_suspended` | WinAMZ 系统 | `agent_id`, `actor_id` | Agent 被挂起 |
+| `grant_created` | WinAMZ 系统 | `agent_id`, `user_id` | 用户完成 OAuth 同意，委托创建 |
+| `grant_revoked` | WinAMZ 系统 | `agent_id`, `user_id`, `actor_id` | Kill Switch 触发，委托撤销 |
+| `agent_action` | **下游系统上报** | `agent_id`, `user_id`, `resource` | Agent 代替用户执行了业务操作 |
+| `token_issued` | WinAMZ 系统 | `agent_id` | 向 Agent 颁发令牌 |
 
