-## Step 1: Register Your API Resource in WinAMZ
+## 步骤二：注册 Agent（由 Agent 开发方完成）
 
-In WinAMZ Admin Console (`http://localhost:4002`):
-1. **API Resources** → Create → Enter your API Identifier (e.g., `https://erp.winamz.com`)
-2. Create Scopes: `erp:read`, `erp:write`, `erp:admin`
+```bash
+# OpenClaw 开发方调用 WinAMZ API 注册 Agent
+curl -X POST http://your-host:4001/api/winamz/agents \
+  -H "Authorization: Bearer $ADMIN_TOKEN" \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{
+    "name": "OpenClaw v2.1",
+    "type": "personal",
+    "orgId": "company-org-id",
+    "ownerUserId": "zhangsan-user-id",
+    "requestedScopes": ["erp:read", "erp:write"]
+  }'
+```
+
+**响应：**
+```json
+{
+  "id": "openclaw-agent-id",
+  "name": "OpenClaw v2.1",
+  "type": "personal",
+  "status": "pending_review",
+  "requestedScopes": ["erp:read", "erp:write"],
+  "createdAt": "2026-03-11T10:00:00Z"
+}
+```
+
+管理员在 Console 中批准后，Agent 状态变为 `approved`。
 
